    "review_notes": "Placed in canonical link frames from the DH table; sizes from STL bounding boxes. The forearm capsule is centered on the J4 axis. Upper-arm and forearm capsules stop short of the elbow (covered by elbow_body) so the teach-pendant poses stay clear; elbow folds below about J3 = -50 deg report a conservative collision. Visual QA recommended."
